# Owezy UI rules

- Source of truth: `docs/DESIGN_SPEC.md`, `design-tokens/tokens.json`, and the screenshots in `screenshots/light` and `screenshots/dark`.
- Never hard-code colours. Use the tokens (`design-tokens/tokens.css` variables, `theme.ts`, or the Tailwind preset). Light and dark share token names.
- Primary is #635BDB for fills. For violet text/icons use `primaryText` (dark mode lightens it to #9C96FF).
- Money: owed/lent/received = `owed` token with "+", you owe/borrowed = `owe` token with "−". Always add a sign or a label; never colour alone.
- Font: Inter (fonts/inter). Numbers use tabular figures.
- Frame 390 × 844, side padding 20, content starts at 56, tab bar 88, touch targets ≥ 44.
- Icons: only the SVGs in `assets/icons` (outline, stroke 1.9, round caps, currentColor). No emoji, no other icon sets unless asked.
- Cards: radius 22–24 with 1 px `border` in light mode; dark mode uses surface steps instead of shadows. No gradients.
- Match the screenshots pixel-for-pixel before adding anything new.
